== hb_mapper checker --help ==
Usage: hb_mapper checker [OPTIONS]

  check whether the model meet the requirements.

Options:
  -h, --help                      Show this message and exit.
  --proto TEXT                    caffe prototxt file
  --model PATH                    caffe/onnx model file
  --model-type [caffe|onnx]       [required]
  --march [bernoulli2|bayes|bayes-e]
                                  BPU's micro architectures(J5:bayes,
                                  X5:bayes-e, XJ3:bernoulli2), default bayes

  --input-shape <TEXT TEXT>...    input model_input_name followed by
                                  model_input_shape, model_input_shape should
                                  be seperated by "x", e.g. "input1
                                  1x3x224x224"

  --output TEXT                   parameter [output] is deprecated, log info
                                  will be saved in
                                  hb_mapper_checker_{date_time}.log

